{"hw":"ὑμέτερος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ὑμέτερος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ὑμέτερος</span> <span class=\"gk\">[υ]</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Dor.</span> </span> and <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ὑμός</span> (q.v.): (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ὑμεῖς</span>):—<div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">your, yours,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, etc.; with a Pron. added in gen., <span class=\"gk\">ὑμέτερος ἑκάστου θυμός</span> the courage <b class=\"lex-tr\">of</b> each of <b class=\"lex-tr\">you,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17.226</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὑμέτερος θυμὸς αὐτῶν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">your</b> own mind, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.138</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὑμέτερόνδε</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to your house,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23.86</span> </span>: <span class=\"gk\">τὸ ὑ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">your part, your business,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἢν μὴ τὸ ὑ. αἴτιον γένηται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.140</span> </span>.<span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ά</span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Grg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">522c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ δ' ὑ. πρᾶξαι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">your character</b> is to.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.70</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰ ὑ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">your goods,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.2.12</span> </span>: in Prose sts. with the Article, <span class=\"gk\">ταῖς ὑμετέραις πόλεσι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">836c</span> </span>; and objectively, <span class=\"gk\">αἱ ὑ ἐλπίδες</span> hopes <b class=\"lex-tr\">raised by you,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.69</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ τῇ ὑ. παρακελεύσει</span> for the purpose of advising <b class=\"lex-tr\">you,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">36d</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> poet. (never in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span>) sts. for <span class=\"gk\">σός,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Sol.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.2</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Call.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Del.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">204</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">227</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Nonn.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">D.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.340</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.292</span> </span> (Paul. Sil.).</div></div>"}